sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Владелец
    participant API as API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Reader as Читатель
    Owner->>API: Publish revision, assetRights, If-Match, key
    API->>DB: Lock material, validate ownership and READY assets
    alt Current revision and rights valid
        API->>DB: Atomic snapshot, asset references, audit
        API-->>Owner: 201 publication
        Reader->>API: Catalog detail and content
        API->>DB: Check active account and PUBLISHED snapshot
        API-->>Reader: Metadata and protected bytes
        Owner->>API: Withdraw with publication If-Match
        API->>DB: Atomic WITHDRAWN and audit
        API-->>Owner: 200 WITHDRAWN
        Reader->>API: New content request using old URL
        API->>DB: Check current publication state
        API-->>Reader: 404
    else Conflict or missing rights
        API-->>Owner: 400, 409 or 412 without publication
    end
